      "message": "At this point, we know the arch topology driver normalized the cpu scale. so can we just rely on topology_get_cpu_scale() API to find out the max cpu capacity instead of finding it again based on efficiency and fmax?\n\n- topology_get_cpu_scale() API is no longer needed\n- There is no need for check_max_cap_vs_cpu_scale() checks. because we derive OPP\u0027s capacity based on cpu_scale.\n\nDiscussed this offline with Puja and she is okay with it. \n\nDietmar, let me know your opinion",
